<title>GERMANY: Siemens 5-mth telecoms sales, orders up.</title>
<headline>Siemens 5-mth telecoms sales, orders up.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siemens AG said on Thursday its telecommunications units had boosted sales and orders over the first five months of the 1996/97 business year, profiting from the group's comprehensive product range.</p>
<p>Telecoms unit sales rose by 18 percent to 9.5 billion marks, while incoming orders rose 20 percent to 12.1 billion, the company said at the CEBIT technology fair here.</p>
</text>
